const schema = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'LocalBusiness', name: 'Dream Solutions Tennessee', url: 'https://dreamsolutionstn.com', telephone: '(615) 555-0123', areaServed: ['Nashville, TN', 'Middle Tennessee'], hasOfferCatalog: { '@type': 'OfferCatalog', name: 'Home radon and crawl space services', itemListElement: ['Radon Testing','Radon Mitigation','Crawl Space Encapsulation'].map(name => ({ '@type': 'Offer', itemOffered: { '@type': 'Service', name, serviceType: name } })) } };
---
<Layout title="Radon Testing & Mitigation in Nashville, TN" description="Dream Solutions Tennessee provides radon testing, mitigation system installation, and crawl space encapsulation in Nashville and Middle Tennessee.">
<script slot="head" type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
<Hero home eyebrow="Nashville, Tennessee · Radon & crawl space solutions" title="Peace of mind.<br />From the <em>ground up.</em>" description="Know what’s in your air. Take care of what’s beneath your home. Radon testing, mitigation, and crawl space solutions for Middle Tennessee." />
<div class="intro-strip"><span>Local perspective. Lasting care.</span><span>Testing / Mitigation / Encapsulation</span><a href="#understanding">A healthier home starts here ↓</a></div>
<section class="split-section" id="understanding"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Understand your air</p><h2>You can’t see radon.<br /><em>You can measure it.</em></h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Radon is a naturally occurring radioactive gas that can enter a home from the soil. You can’t see or smell it, and long-term exposure increases the risk of lung cancer.</p><p>Testing is the only way to know your home’s radon level. From an initial test to a system designed for your home, we help you take the next step.</p><div class="stat"><strong>4.0 <small>pCi/L</small></strong><p>EPA action level. The EPA recommends fixing homes at or above this level. Lower levels still carry risk.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="https://www.epa.gov/radon/what-epas-action-level-radon-and-what-does-it-mean">Read the EPA’s guidance ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="services-section"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / What we do</p><h2>Care for your home.<br /><em>Clarity for you.</em></h2></div><div class="service-grid"><ServiceCard number="01" title="Radon testing" description="Start with a measurement. Understand your home’s radon level and what it means." href="/radon-testing" /><ServiceCard number="02" title="Radon mitigation" description="A purpose-built system to collect soil gas and vent it outdoors, away from living spaces." href="/radon-mitigation" /><ServiceCard number="03" title="Crawl space encapsulation" description="A sealed vapor barrier to help manage ground moisture and support a better crawl space." href="/crawl-space-encapsulation" /></div></section>
<section class="split-section area-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Close to home</p><h2>Nashville roots.<br /><em>Middle Tennessee reach.</em></h2></div><div class="prose"><p>Based in Nashville, we serve homeowners throughout the surrounding Middle Tennessee area.</p><p>Every home has its own foundation, conditions, and needs. Tell us where you’re located and what you’re looking to solve.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact">Let’s talk about your home ↗</a></div></section>
<div class="trust-strip"><span>Founded by Khary Cammock<br />& Patrick Donnelly</span><span>Three focused services.<br />One home-first approach.</span><a href="/about">Meet Dream Solutions ↗</a></div><CallToAction />
</Layout>